 and sought-after residential areas in India, Malabar Hill offers residents a serene living experience amidst lush greenery and breathtaking views of the Arabian Sea. The project enjoys seamless connectivity to prominent landmarks such as Hanging Gardens, Babulnath Temple, Breach Candy, and Marine Drive. Essential lifestyle amenities including reputed schools, top-class hospitals, premium shopping destinations, and elite clubs are all within close reach, making it an ideal address for luxury living in South Mumbai.\n\n-Charni Road Railwayb Station : 5 min [...] Lodha Malabar South Mumbai\n Lodha Malabar South Mumbai\n Lodha Malabar South MumbaiOverview\n Lodha Malabar South MumbaiCosting\n Lodha Malabar South Mumbai PlanSite & Floor Plan\n Lodha Malabar South Mumbai AmenitiesAmenities\n Lodha Malabar South Mumbai LocationLocation\n Lodha Malabar South Mumbai Site VisitVirtual Visit\n\nLodha Malabar South Mumbai Image 1 Lodha Malabar South Mumbai Image 1\n\nUnder Construction\n\n# Lodha Malabar South Mumbai\n\n- Lodha Malabar Hills, South Mumbai   \n- Lodha Group\n\n ▸ 31 Floors\n ▸ Possession December : 2026\n ▸ Easy Connectivity\n ▸ Free Pikcup & Drop Facility\n ▸ Great Connectivity\n\n World Class Amenities   Best Pricing     Easy Payment Plan  \n\n-Zero Brokrage Charges\n\n- ₹150 Cr\\ Onwards \n\n#### Pre-Register here for Best Offers\n\nOverview\n\nLodha Malabar South Mumbai","score":0.8488849,"raw_content":null,"id":"0e4bc6-01"},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-malabar/208302/project","title":"Lodha Malabar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Price on Request","content":"## Amenities & Specifications of Lodha Malabar\n\nLuxury at Lodha Malabar extends beyond the residences into a carefully curated collection of lifestyle experiences. Rather than offering a conventional clubhouse, the development introduces Club Saint Amand, an exclusive private members' club where hospitality, wellness, leisure, and social experiences come together in an intimate setting. Complementing this is a dedicated hospitality team that delivers personalized services inspired by the standards of leading luxury hotels.\n\n### Wellness & Recreation\n\n Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Party Hall, Clubhouse, Rain Water Harvesting, Sewage Treatment Plant\n Private Wellness Facilities\n Leisure Spaces\n Relaxation Zones [...] ### What amenities are available at Lodha Malabar?\n\nResidents have access to Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Party Hall, Clubhouse, Rain Water Harvesting, Sewage Treatment Plant, along with the exclusive Club Saint Amand, hospitality services, wellness facilities, leisure spaces, and curated lifestyle experiences.\n\n### What is the possession status of Lodha Malabar?\n\nThe project is currently Under Construction, with possession expected by Jun 2028.\n\n### What is the RERA registration number of Lodha Malabar?\n\nThe project is registered under MahaRERA with registration number P51900034949, P51900055626.\n\n### Why should buyers consider Lodha Malabar? [...] ### Where is Lodha Malabar located?\n\nLodha Malabar is located at Malabar Hill Mumbai, on Walkeshwar Road in Malabar Hill, Mumbai. The project overlooks the Arabian Sea and Hanging Gardens while enjoying connectivity to Gopi Birla Memorial School, Malabar Hill, Wilson College, Kamathipura, Walkeshwar Temple, Malabar Hill.\n\n### What makes Lodha Malabar unique?\n\nThe project combines a landmark Malabar Hill address, contemporary Art Deco-inspired architecture, panoramic sea views, Club Saint Amand, and personalized hospitality services to create an exclusive luxury residential experience.\n\n### What amenities are available at Lodha Malabar?","score":0.8098936,"raw_content":null,"id":"842116-02"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/lodha-seamont-facilities-malabar-hill-south-mumbai-npxid-r293999","title":"Lodha Seamont Amenities - Malabar Hill, Mumbai - 99acres.com","content":"Lodha Seamont, Malabar Hill, Mumbai South comes with a comprehensive set of working amenities such as swimming pool, gym, children's play area, car parking,","score":0.78074646,"raw_content":null,"id":"3fc6fb-03"},{"url":"https://propertybutler.in/insights/lodha-malabar-malabar-hill-complete-review-2026","title":"Lodha Malabar Malabar Hill — Complete Review 2026: Prices, Configurations, Sea vs Garden View & Who Should Buy | Property Butler","content":"## Lodha Malabar Amenities\n\n Infinity pool: High-floor level pool with sea views — among the most photographed amenity in Mumbai luxury residential\n Private lift lobbies: Upper floors have private lobby-to-residence access\n Clubhouse: Resident-only with low resident-to-amenity ratio\n Gymnasium: Fully-equipped, professional-grade\n Concierge: 24x7 hotel-style concierge and valet\n Spa: Treatment rooms, sauna, steam\n Basement parking: 2–3 designated spots per unit\n Security: Multi-tier access control, 24x7 manned security, biometric entry\n Generator backup: 100% common area and apartment generator backup\n\n## Lodha Malabar vs Lodha Seamont vs Kalpataru Prive — How to Choose [...] Garden-Facing Units (East)\n\n Hanging Gardens and Kamala Nehru Park ridge view\n Sunrise view from bedroom\n PSF: 15–20% below sea-facing equivalent\n Lower thermal load — east morning sun only\n No sea spray concern\n Value proposition for buyers who prioritise livability over pure sea view\n\nProperty Butler's assessment: for buyers staying under Rs 35 Cr, the garden-facing 3–4 BHK at Lodha Malabar delivers extraordinary quality of living at a meaningful discount. The Hanging Gardens view is unique to Mumbai — no other luxury building looks over this park from a comparable elevation. It is not a consolation prize; it is a different but equally prestigious prospect.\n\n## Lodha Malabar Amenities [...] Project Snapshot — Lodha Malabar, Malabar Hill\n\nDeveloper: Lodha Group in association with Malabar Hill Trust | Location: Ridge Road, Malabar Hill, Mumbai 400006 | Status: Delivered — OC received | Configurations: 3 BHK to 6 BHK | Height: Approximately 40 storeys | Facing: Sea-facing (Arabian Sea) and Garden-facing | Primary market: Closed — secondary resale only\n\n## Why Lodha Malabar Is Different From Every Other Lodha Project on the Hill","score":0.75290436,"raw_content":null,"id":"85c674-04"},{"url":"https://houssed.com/mumbai/lodha-group/lodha-malabar-149580","title":"Lodha Malabar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai | 4 BHK Ultra Luxury Apartments | Houssed","content":"Carpet Area\n\n3826 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n49 Cr\n\n## Key Features of Lodha Malabar Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n## Amenities Lodha Malabar Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n### Convenience\n\n### Safety\n\n### Sports\n\n### Leisure\n\n### Environment\n\n### Home Specifications\n\n## Google Map Location of Lodha Malabar Malabar Hill\n\n## Locality Overview of Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nMalabar Hill is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Malabar Hill region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Malabar Hill is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes [...] Upgraded public spaces and heritage conservation initiatives\n\n### Micro-Local Happenings That Influence Value\n\nSouth Mumbai continues to evolve socially, with:\n\nPremium cafés and fine-dining restaurants\n\nPrivate members’ clubs and lounges\n\nCultural venues and curated social spaces\n\n### Lifestyle Amenities Within the Project\n\nPrivate pools and wellness zones\n\nFully equipped fitness clubs\n\nSpa, sauna, and relaxation lounges\n\nLandscaped gardens and social spaces\n\n## 4. Notable Landmarks\n\nHanging Gardens & Kamala Nehru Park\n\nBanganga Tank (historic and cultural significance)\n\nMarine Drive\n\nGovernor’s House vicinity\n\nExclusive clubs, temples, and heritage sites\n\n## 5. Builder Profile [...] Houssed\nwhatsapp\nProject Image of Lodha Malabar in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 317154\nAmenities of Lodha Malabar in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 317155\nAmenities of Lodha Malabar in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 317156\nAmenities of Lodha Malabar in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 317157\nLocation of Lodha Malabar in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 317158\n\n## Project Overview of Lodha Malabar Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nProject Status\n\nNew Launch\n\nNo. of Units\n\n66 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n1.08 Acres\n\nOwnership\n\nFreehold\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n2 Towers  / 22 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Lodha Malabar Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n4 BHK Flat in Lodha Malabar in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 868263\n\nCarpet Area\n\n3826 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n49 Cr","score":0.69845337,"raw_content":null,"id":"6c0bc5-05"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/lodha-malabar-walkeshwar-south-mumbai-npxid-r390307","title":"Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar, Mumbai South - 99acres.com","content":"This includes a club house, landscape garden, and easy access to open space. It also has a car parking, an exclusive offering only for Lodha Malabar residents.","score":0.5852203,"raw_content":null,"id":"f067f1-06"},{"url":"https://www.jllhomes.co.in/apartments-new/mumbai/lodha-malabar","title":"Lodha Malabar | Mumbai Apartments properties | JLL Homes","content":"Facilities. Swimming Pool; Park; Gym; Indoor Game Room; WiFi; Intercom; Visitor Parking; Car Parking; Security; Sewage Treatment Plant; Power Backup; Children","score":0.5524679,"raw_content":null,"id":"aa1c40-07"}],"response_time":0.0,"request_id":"01ef90d2-40ae-43f1-bd51-de0552261c4d"}